  "pre_gateway_change_conclusion": "Direct board HTTP and both TLS versions reach a nearby TCP terminator which acknowledges the entire request and sends FIN without any response payload. The same board curl succeeds with normal TLS certificate validation through a one-target LAN relay using the build host public-egress path. This isolates the web failure to the OpenWrt gateway/public-egress path; DNS, time, board TLS and basic Ethernet transport are working. The exact gateway proxy/firewall service has not yet been inspected. Direct browser access is still not accepted.",
